OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain is
OL,6,Fexpected to clear to the east this
OL,7,Fevening to leave a brighter end to the
OL,8,Fday. Turning chilly overnight under
OL,9,Fclear skies and lighter winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FA dry day on Monday with light
OL,12,Fwinds and prolonged spells of
OL,13,Fsunshine. Chilly at first, but warm in
OL,14,Fthe afternoon. Sunshine turning hazy
OL,15,Fat times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
